<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Mari Gas first half net up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Mari Gas first half net up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended</p>
<p>December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		  2,445 vs 1,839</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 154 vs  83</p>
<p>    After-tax profit     142 vs  62</p>
<p>Interim dividend  10 pct vs 7.5 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Mari Gas Company Ltd. It owns a gas field and distributes gas. The company carried forward 106 million to the balance sheet. Book closure will be announced later. -- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685</p>
</text>
